.TH HANDBOOK 1 "2026-11-09" "nni @VERSION@" "nni family manual"
.SH NAME
handbook \- the YnniOS / SGnniOS handbook
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B handbook
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the handbook of this system in a pager (less by default; set
.B PAGER
to choose another). It covers the live system, packages, networking, the
desktop, installing to a disk (the hard way, on purpose), what to do after
installing, and the nni tools. Press
.B q
to quit,
.B /
to search.
.SH FILES
.IR /usr/share/nni/handbook\-ynnios.txt ,
.I /usr/share/nni/handbook\-sgnnios.txt
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR nni (8),
.BR svc (8),
.BR wifi (8),
.BR pol (8),
.BR spol (8)
